   "text": "RJ's fall 2026 Denver immersion ran as **two groups, one week each** (roughly 4–9 Oct and 11–16 Oct 2026), working at the **Tennyson Center for Children**, 2950 Tennyson St., Denver 80212, in the Berkeley neighborhood of Northwest Denver. ✅ (RJ trip blog, *Immersion Experience: Denver*; Colorado Gives profile for the address). Students spent the school day in Tennyson's classrooms — drawing, writing, games, basketball, getting to know the children — and the evenings cooking, decompressing in a park or coffee shop, and in long reflection. ✅. A Tennyson staff member met the group beforehand to prepare them. ✅.",
